{"id":"9d01ba91fb099b79","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-modal-self-referential-correctness.md","title":"K, K4, and G Are Self-Referentially Correct","display":"thm-modal-self-referential-correctness — K, K4, and G Are Self-Referentially Correct","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-modal-self-referential-correctness","aliases":["92-thm-modal-self-referential-correctness"],"display":"thm-modal-self-referential-correctness — K, K4, and G Are Self-Referentially Correct","source":"第 XI 章 p. 134（PDF 151）；原书引 Smullyan [1987] 为证明来源","source_status":"原书引用的定理；完整证明未重建","depends_on":["[[92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-modal-self-referential-correctness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-modal-self-referential-correctness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-modal-self-referential-correctness — K, K4, and G Are Self-Referentially Correct"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 134（PDF 151）；原书引 Smullyan [1987] 为证明来源"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书引用的定理；完整证明未重建"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7d011f131f5a8d4d\" href=\"?note=7d011f131f5a8d4d\" title=\"92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness\">92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>模态演算与 letterless 真值采用上述指定版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}modal\\text{-}self\\text{-}referential\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{SRC}(\\mathsf K_{\\Box})\\land\n\\operatorname{SRC}(\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box})\\land\n\\operatorname{SRC}(\\mathsf G_{\\Box}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}modal\\text{-}self\\text{-}referential\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{SRC}(\\mathsf K_{\\Box})\\land\n\\operatorname{SRC}(\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box})\\land\n\\operatorname{SRC}(\\mathsf G_{\\Box}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依据原书 p.134 的明确陈述，完整证明被指向 Smullyan, Forever Undecided: A Puzzle Guide to Gödel (1987)。本任务未读取该外部证明，登记为可靠来源陈述，不宣称完整机器证明。</p>\n<p>不能用“每条规则保真”省略 Löb 公理的自指真值验证；后续只用明示的 letterless 正确性及直接可证推论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness","status":"resolved","id":"7d011f131f5a8d4d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}modal\\text{-}self\\text{-}referential\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{SRC}(\\mathsf K_{\\Box})\\land\n\\operatorname{SRC}(\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box})\\land\n\\operatorname{SRC}(\\mathsf G_{\\Box}).","display":true}],"bytes":1262,"backlinks":[{"id":"bb3ae520d70609fb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-letterless-truth]] → [[92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness]] → [[92-thm-modal-self-referential-correctness]] → [[92-cor-modal-consistency-and-stability]]。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-286","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-modal-self-referential-correctness]]"}],"outgoing":["7d011f131f5a8d4d"]}